{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/c6fc822cbebf379846cc4874b854ff23.avif?t=1757738233\" data-has-big width=1560 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.poster.avif?t=1757738233\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.webm?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/32e046eb075500af132630bb6f9ffe40.mp4?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and customize</strong> <strong>your ship</strong> with tons of unique parts. Equip railguns, versatile turrets, and other exciting modifiable weapons. Fortify your core with armor plating, energy shields, and specialized modules to survive the harshest corners of space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space itself is leaking. Mysterious tears in the fabric of reality are opening across the universe, revealing unstable pocket dimensions. Explore these rifts to uncover rare, valuable materials and hidden relics that awaits your discovery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.poster.avif?t=1757738233\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.webm?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/209b24d55a3f734a06c069b97ca33e61.mp4?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine asteroids, scavenge the wreckage of destroyed ships. Discover the fate of fallen crews you find in the forgotten battlefields.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.poster.avif?t=1757738233\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.webm?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e0fb4e150f90b60326e7c4156b5c230d.mp4?t=1757738233\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in intense space battles against relentless drones, ruthless space pirates, and colossal space-dwelling creatures. These alien lifeforms are not humanoid but living hazards of the void, like the ore-devouring amoebas that split into swarms lurking between the stars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3561170?t=1757738233","background